From: Nitin Kalavala <202352552+nitin-kalavala@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 02:10:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] SONiC-ONLY: Distribute the protection encoder header

Keep the shared encoder with the provider sources in distribution tarballs.
Apply after the MAC provider source split without modifying its patch.

Signed-off-by: Nitin Kalavala <202352552+nitin-kalavala@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/zebra/subdir.am
+++ b/zebra/subdir.am
@@ -251,6 +251,7 @@ module_LTLIBRARIES += zebra/dplane_fpm_sonic.la
 zebra_dplane_fpm_sonic_la_SOURCES = zebra/dplane_fpm_sonic.c zebra/fpm_mac.c
 zebra_dplane_fpm_sonic_la_LDFLAGS = $(MODULE_LDFLAGS)
 zebra_dplane_fpm_sonic_la_LIBADD  = -lnexthopgroup
+zebra_dplane_fpm_sonic_la_SOURCES += zebra/bridge_port_protection.h
 
 if NETLINK_DEBUG
 zebra_zebra_SOURCES += \
